<title>INDIA: India's Asian Paints 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Asian Paints 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   553.8     vs    533.5</p>
<p>    Sales		7,371.9     vs  7,045.8</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	7.5     vs	6.5</p>
<p>     Other income	 75.54    vs     97.61</p>
<p>     Expenditure     6,206.6     vs  6,108.0</p>
<p>     Interest	    216.8     vs    141.71</p>
<p>     Depreciation	121.14    vs     90.23</p>
<p>     Tax		   300.0     vs    270.0</p>
<p>Note: Asian Paints (India) Ltd is among India's largest paint companies.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
